# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep host-built
# artefacts out of the images. Without this, `COPY frontend/ ./` would drop a
# Windows/macOS node_modules on top of the Linux `npm ci` result.

# dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# local database and data
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite3

# test and tool caches
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/coverage.xml

# environment: never bake real configuration into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# vcs, docs and editors — not needed at build time
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
docs
*.md
!README.md
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
